          %title Selected writings:
          %p
            Bob Rosebrugh is a
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theorist
            %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/"} Theory and Applications of Categories
            and served as its managing editor for 25 years.
          %p
            %a{:href => "http://www.mta.ca/~rrosebru/"} webpage
          %p
            A short biography and list of publications of Bob Rosebrugh appeared in the foreword to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/index.html#vol36"} The Rosebrugh Festschrift
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marino+Gran"}> Marino Gran
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"} Michael Johnson
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Walter+Tholen"} Walter Tholen
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+J.+Wood"} R. J. Wood
              = succeed "," do
                %em Foreword
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/36/fwd/36-fwd.pdf"} pdf
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings:
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/indexed+categories"} indexed categories
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/P.+T.+Johnstone"}> P. T. Johnstone
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+Par%C3%A9"} R. Paré
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+D.+Rosebrugh"} R. D. Rosebrugh
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D.+Schumacher"} D. Schumacher
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+J.+Wood"} R. J. Wood
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G.+C.+Wraith"} G. C. Wraith
              = succeed "," do
                %em Indexed Categories and Their Applications
              %strong 661
              (1978) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/bfb0061362"}> doi:10.1007/bfb0061362
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Characterizing the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+sets"} category of sets
            as that whose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yoneda+embedding"} Yoneda embedding
            extends to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+adjoint"} left
            to an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quintuple"} adjoint quintuple
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+functors"} adjoint functors
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"}> Robert Rosebrugh
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+J.+Wood"} Richard J. Wood
              = succeed "." do
                %em An adjoint characterization of the category of sets
              %strong 122
              2 (1994) 409-413 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/2161031"}> jstor:2161031
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quadruples"} adjoint quadruples
            with a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+adjoint"} right adjoint
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Rosebrugh"}> Bob Rosebrugh
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+J.+Wood"} Richard J. Wood
              = succeed "," do
                %em Distributive Adjoint Strings
              %strong 1
              6 (1995) 119-145 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/1995/n6/1-06abs.html"}> tac:1-06
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributive+laws"} distributive laws
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/factorization+systems"} factorization systems
          %ul
            %li#RosebrughWood02
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"}> Robert Rosebrugh
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+J.+Wood"} Richard J. Wood
              = succeed "," do
                %em Distributive Laws and Factorization
              %strong 175
              1–3 (2002) 327-353 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0022-4049(02)00140-8"} doi:10.1016/S0022-4049(02)00140-8
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.mta.ca/~rrosebru/articles/fac.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Introduction to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set+theory"} set theory
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/foundations+of+mathematics"} foundations of mathematics
            from a practical and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorical+logic"} category theoretic
            point of view known as
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structural+set+theory"} structural set theory
            (“informal
            = succeed "\u201D):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ETCS"} ETCS
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Lawvere"}> William Lawvere
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"} Robert Rosebrugh
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sets+for+Mathematics"} Sets for Mathematics
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511755460"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511755460
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.mta.ca/~rrosebru/setsformath/"} book homepage
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://books.google.de/books?id=h3_7aZz9ZMoC&pg=PP1&dq=sets+for+mathematics"} GoogleBooks
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://patryshev.com/books/Sets%20for%20Mathematics.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lenses+%28in+computer+science%29"} lenses (in computer science)
          %ul
            %li#JohnsonRosebrughWood10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"}> Michael Johnson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"} Robert Rosebrugh
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Wood"} Richard Wood
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebras and Update Strategies
                %strong 16
                (2010) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.3217/jucs-016-05-0729"}> doi:10.3217/jucs-016-05-0729
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"}> Michael Johnson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"} Robert Rosebrugh
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+J.+Wood"} Richard J. Wood
                %em Lenses, fibrations and universal translations
                Math. Structures Comput. Sci.
                %strong 22
                1 (2012) 25–42 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129511000442"}> doi:10.1017/S0960129511000442
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#JohnsonRosebrugh16
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"}> Michael Johnson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"} Robert Rosebrugh
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Unifying Set-Based, Delta-Based and Edit-Based Lenses
                %strong 1571
                (2016) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1571/paper_13.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"}> Michael Johnson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Rosebrugh"} Robert Rosebrugh
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The more legs the merrier: A new composition for symmetric (multi-)lenses
                %strong 333
                (2021) 92-107 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.10482"}> arXiv:2101.10482
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.333.7"} doi:10.4204/EPTCS.333.7
